---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /work/
title: Work
description: Every piece — sensors, macropads and the boards underneath them, with the specification and source for each.
---
{% from "partials/piece-tile.njk" import tile %}

<section class="wrap band">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="label">01 — work</span>
    <h1 class="h1" style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.05;">Everything on the bench.</h1>
    <p class="lede prose" style="margin-top: var(--space-5);">
      {{ collections.pieces | length }} pieces. Specification on each one — board size, parts, what it costs to
      build. Schematics and firmware are on GitHub.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="piece-grid">
    {%- for piece in collections.pieces %}
    {{ tile(piece) }}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="rule">
<section class="band band--invert">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label label--on-dark" style="display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">02 — order</span>
    <h2 class="h1" style="color: var(--white);">Want one of these, or something near it?</h2>
    <p class="lede on-dark-body" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
      Tell me the dimensions and what it has to do. I will tell you whether I can build it, what it would take,
      and what it would cost.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--invert" href="/order/">Start an enquiry</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
